Depends: qt6-base, qt6-declarative, qt6-svg, qt6-sensors, qt6-wayland, kf6-bluezqt, kf6-config, kf6-configwidgets, kf6-coreaddons, kf6-dbusaddons, kf6-globalaccel, kf6-i18n, kf6-itemmodels, kf6-jobwidgets, kf6-kcmutils, kf6-kio, kf6-kirigami-addons, kf6-notifications, kf6-package, kf6-service, kf6-windowsystem, kwayland, kwin, libplasma, milou (>= 6.1.5+ios1), plasma-workspace (>= 6.1.5+ios11), plasma-nano, plasma5support, plasma-pa
Description: Plasma Mobile shell data for Xios
 Plasma Mobile provides the mobile look-and-feel, shell package, private mobile
 shell QML plugin family, containment plugins, quicksetting package data, and
 session entry files for the KDE mobile flavor.
 .
 This iOS package is intentionally trimmed to the shell path. Its
 Mobile status and quick-settings providers are backed by Xios/iOS bridges for
 battery, brightness, audio, network reachability, and wallpaper state. Search
 uses the real KRunner-backed Milou model; KCMs,
 KWin effects, and full modem/network management remain deferred.
